abstract: >-
  An AI teaching-video demonstration site: the course website for the NTNU
  course Learning Analytics Tools Implementation Applications, with AI-made
  teaching videos with chapters and key points, an interactive weekly review
  site in four languages, and a student work showcase. The code
  is licensed under MIT (LICENSE); the course content (videos, posters,
  thumbnails and course text) is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  (LICENSE-CONTENT.md). Student work and third-party items are not covered
  (NOTICE.md).
